<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Notation Table</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We summarize the frequently used notations in <a href="#A1.T5" title="In Appendix A Notation Table ‣ PANTHER: Generative Pretraining Beyond Language for Sequential User Behavior Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Notations used in this paper</figcaption>
<div id="A1.T5.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:542.9pt;vertical-align:-268.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(4.9pt,-7.7pt) scale(1.02932896846532,1.02932896846532) ;">
<table id="A1.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Notation</span>
</span></th>
<th id="A1.T5.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Descrpition</span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{X}_{u}=[x_{1},x_{2},\ldots,x_{L}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{X}_{u}=[x_{1},x_{2},\ldots,x_{L}]</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The payment behavior sequence of length <math id="A1.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> for a user <math id="A1.T5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u\in\mathcal{U}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u\in\mathcal{U}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}\in\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}\in\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The transaction token at time step <math id="A1.T5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.T5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math> is the set of possible transaction tokens.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P(y=1\mid x_{\mathrm{new}},\mathbf{c}_{\mathrm{new}},\mathbf{X}_{u})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐜</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P(y=1\mid x_{\mathrm{new}},\mathbf{c}_{\mathrm{new}},\mathbf{X}_{u})</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Fraud probability for new transaction <math id="A1.T5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\mathrm{new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\mathrm{new}}</annotation></semantics></math> with contextual feature <math id="A1.T5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{c}_{\mathrm{new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐜</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{c}_{\mathrm{new}}</annotation></semantics></math>, given <math id="A1.T5.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{X}_{u}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{X}_{u}</annotation></semantics></math>. The <math id="A1.T5.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math> is an indicator variable for fraud.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{gen}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>gen</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{gen}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The generative loss function for next behavior prediction</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\theta}(x_{t}\mid x_{&lt;t},x_{\text{profile}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>profile</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\theta}(x_{t}\mid x_{&lt;t},x_{\text{profile}})</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The probability of the <math id="A1.T5.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>-th transaction <math id="A1.T5.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> given the previous transactions <math id="A1.T5.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{&lt;t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{&lt;t}</annotation></semantics></math>, user profile features <math id="A1.T5.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\text{profile}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>profile</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\text{profile}}</annotation></semantics></math> and model parameters <math id="A1.T5.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e_{u}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e_{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The learned user profile embedding for user <math id="A1.T5.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>u</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{\phi}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{\phi}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Real-time fraud detection model that integrates features including recent patterns, predicted deviations, and user profiles for risk prediction, typically a DCN network.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The embedding function for transaction context features, typically in the form of a linear layer.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\mathrm{enc}}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>enc</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\mathrm{enc}}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Sequence encoder for user’s recent short-term payment behaviors, typically a TextCNN model.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.T5.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta(x_{\text{new}},\hat{x}_{L+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta(x_{\text{new}},\hat{x}_{L+1})</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.2.1.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The deviation between the observed new transaction <math id="A1.T5.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\text{new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math> and the predicted next behavior <math id="A1.T5.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{x}_{L+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{x}_{L+1}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
