<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Transferability of PANTHER</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We examine PANTHER ’s capacity to transfer learned representations to new users, new datasets, and new domains. The experiments showcase the advantage of generative pretraining in label scarcity and cross-domain scenarios.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Comparison of PANTHER with cold-start and user transfer settings on WeChatPay.</figcaption>
